  "reflectionText": "Micah lifted the question: with what shall I come before the Lord? Shall I come with thousands of rams, with rivers of oil? He has shown you, O man, what is good: to act justly, to love mercy, to walk humbly with your God. What is it to find that the thing required is smaller than the offering, and harder to bring?"
